# Files kept out of the image build context: the build needs the workspace sources, the lockfile and the notices configuration only.
# Local build output (it can be gigabytes and is rebuilt in the image).
target
# The contract tests' installed packages; the image never runs them.
**/node_modules
# Repository history and CI configuration.
.git
.github
# Documentation (the image carries only the licence notices it generates).
*.md
# Environment files can hold secrets; a context must never carry them.
.env*
